The 2015 mainline offerings consist of 75 HW City, 50 HW Off-Road, 60 HW Race and 65 HW Workshop, for a total of 250 cars. Segments are comprised of either 5 or 10 cars. See [[2015 New Models]] and [[:Category:New for 2015|Category New for 2015]] for a list of new models and [[2015 Treasure Hunts Series]] for a list of Treasure Hunts cars.

